pt\nclass QueryAnnotation extends DependencyAnnotation {\n        descendants: boolean;\n        selector: void;\n        isVarBindingQuery: boolean;\n        varBindings: List<string>;\n        toString(): string;\n}\n\nclass Query extends DependencyAnnotation {\n        descendants: boolean;\n        selector: void;\n        isVarBindingQuery: boolean;\n        varBindings: List<string>;\n        toString(): string;\n}\n```\n\nAfter adapting the d.ts file to have:\n\n``` typescript\nvar Query: any;\n```\n\nand removing the above Query class the annotation works as expected...\n\nAnother issue can be seen here:\n\n``` typescript\nclass BaseQueryList<T> {\n        reset(newList: any): void;\n        add(obj: any): void;\n        fireCallbacks(): void;\n        onChange(callback: any): void;\n        removeCallback(callback: any): void;\n        length: void;\n        first: void;\n        last: void;\n}\n```\n\nThe length, first and last properties are declared as void, I also constantly need to adapt these to have working code :)\n","closed_by":{"login":"rkirov","id":95713,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1NzEz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95713?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rkirov","html_url":"https://github.com/rkirov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rkirov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rkirov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rkirov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rkirov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rkirov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rkirov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rkirov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rkirov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rkirov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github